{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>數碼通（SmarTone）今日（26日）下午指，指部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，現正積極調查及跟進。SmarTone表示，會盡力減低對客戶的影響，若有進一步消息會適時公布。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:42:52.292217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:19:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:16.313637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:16.313637+00:00","content_hash":"d6cb180cc259da00534ae0a6b10da5f9947245e5addf4afc13042022cd97bccf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}